      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تجوّه</span></b>  <i>He magnified himself;</i> or <i>was,</i> or
<i>became, proud, haughty,</i> or <i>disdainful:</i> or <i>he
affected rank, station,</i> or <i>dignity, not possessing
it.</i> (TA.)

